 star  to speak out about Rowling's beliefs Tom  Felton who portrayed Draco Malfoy in the  franchise recently told the independent  last month I'm pro-choice Pro discussion  pro-human rights across the board and  prologue and anything that is not those  things I don't really have much time for  and we don't have time for that either  thanks Daniel and Tom keep spreading the  love  foreign hey thanks for watching ET  Canada if you want more queer  entertainment news and exclusive  interviews be sure to subscribe and  check out these videos
 

